  "headline": "No public FDA shortage signal for zolpidem tartrate at our supply plants; internal inventory shows Corvale Lakeside at 5 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["E1", "E3", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's public shortage database shows no active shortage signal for zolpidem tartrate from the Sandoz Inc. manufacturing plant that supplies all three Corvale sites.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E3", "E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds only 12 tablets with a daily use of 2.2, yielding 5 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["E3", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 216 packages with a daily use of 6.2, yielding 35 days of supply and can spare 19 packages while retaining a two-week buffer.",
      "cites": ["E1", "D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 19 packages from Corvale East to Corvale Lakeside would raise Lakeside's inventory to approximately 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 135 tablets at 8.1 per day for 17 days on hand and is not part of the recommended transfer.",
      "cites": ["E2", "D2"]
    }
  ]
